  m_text: "Runtime: 134 minutes\n\nRelease: April\u202F18,\u202F2024\n\nDescription:
    A thrilling Malaysian action-crime thriller starring Zul Ariffin as Investigator
    Sheriff Hussein. He's on the hunt for a vigilante \u201CMeth Killer\u201D targeting
    narcotics officers, uncovering corruption, betrayal, and intense moral dilemmas.
    Co-stars include Syafiq Kyle, Aaron Aziz, Elizabeth Tan, and Azira Shafinaz \nCinema
    Chords"
