  m_text: "Format: TV series of 8 episodes, split into two parts; each episode ~45\u201357
    minutes \n\nRelease Date: Part 1 on August\u202F6,\u202F2025; Part 2 on September\u202F3,\u202F2025
    (Netflix) \n\nDescription: Follows Wednesday Addams at Nevermore Academy as she
    hones psychic powers, solves mysteries, and faces rising threats. The split season
    builds on her supernatural detective role with a fresh storyline"
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8f586378b4e144a9851e7b34d9b748ee, type: 2}
